      "title": "Habanos uses national orchestra´s name as cover for illicit revenue generation",
      "summary": "An invoice obtained by Cigarrvärlden shows that the Swedish importer of Cuban cigars is taking the provisions of the Tobacco Act lightly and has sold to private individuals without the license to do so. And without being aware of it themselves, the Gothenburg Symphony Orchestra (Göteborgs Symfoniker AB) found themselves listed as the buyer, at least on paper. This has reportedly been going on for many years.",
      "category": [
        "Sverige",
        "Kuba"
      ],
      "status": "Trovärdig källa",
      "image": "http://cigarrklubben.se/cdn/shop/articles/Montage_Goteborgs_Symfoniorkester_COHIBA_23c4f9c9-4fd3-4003-a60e-8ba6f9e3a165_1200x1200.jpg?v=1788697647",
